# Agent configuration. Kept on disk for local tooling, never published: this
# repo is public, and these files describe cross-repo behaviour the rest of the
# platform owns. The publishable half lives in docs/.
#
# CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md are ignored as well as their local variants, so a
# committed one can never reappear. Contributor-facing agent setup belongs in
# docs/authoring.md, which an agent does not auto-load.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
.mcp.json
